      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.10498046875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "are unavailable, the GDG judged the likely benefits of retaining moxifloxacin as part of the regimen as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98884391784668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        524.5292358398438,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "outweighing the potential harms; therefore, WHO suggests using the BPaLM regimen in this situation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979029655456543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.3826904296875,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "The establishment and strengthening of DST services is a vital consideration for implementation of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.415771484375,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "all treatment regimens for MDR/RR-TB. In patients with bacteriologically confirmed MDR/RR-TB, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        127.41858673095703,
        527.3701171875,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "sl Xpert  MTB/XDR (Cepheid) or GenoType  MTBDR  (Hain Lifescience) assays may be used as the initial  ® ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.95405387878418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        140.6186065673828,
        527.4039916992188,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "(40, 41) test, in place of culture and phenotypic DST, to detect resistance to fluoroquinolones  . The WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.951894760131836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.5401000976562,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "has recently endorsed the use of targeted next-generation sequencing (NGS) for the detection of drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965546607971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4122314453125,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "resistance, as outlined in the “WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 3: Diagnosis –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.07568359375,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "rapid diagnostics for tuberculosis detection, third edition” (Geneva: World Health Organization; 2024).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975522994995117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.400390625,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "Targeted NGS involves amplifying specific genes and then using sequencing technology to identify",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.1616821289062,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "resistance markers to multiple drugs in one test. This method can scrutinize entire genes for mutations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968504905700684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4342651367188,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "linked to resistance, potentially offering greater accuracy than other molecular tests recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4376220703125,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "by WHO. It is particularly useful for detecting resistance to three drugs in the BPaLM regimen –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.4232788085938,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline, linezolid, and moxifloxacin. For pretomanid, the fourth drug in this regimen, new drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        524.2073364257812,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "susceptibility testing (DST) criteria have been set. Countries implementing programs to manage drug-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97467041015625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.4388427734375,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "resistant TB (DR-TB) should develop lab infrastructure to perform culture-based phenotypic DST for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3681640625,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "drugs used in multidrug-resistant/rifampicin-resistant TB (MDR/RR-TB) treatments, where reliable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        527.6466674804688,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "methods exist (e.g., bedaquiline, linezolid, pretomanid, cycloserine, clofazimine, and delamanid).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        527.1636962890625,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "Additionally, the latest guidelines include a new molecular test for pyrazinamide, which should simplify",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969608306884766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.418701171875,
        174.52099609375,
        341.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "(42) its testing process  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.406982421875,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Currently, there is limited capacity globally for DST for bedaquiline and linezolid. As these medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.1206665039062,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "and regimens containing these medicines become more widely used, laboratory capacity in this area",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995348930358887,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.4376220703125,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "must be strengthened. National and reference laboratories will need to have necessary facilities and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.380615234375,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "reagents to make DST available; also, they will need data on the minimum inhibitory concentration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.922607421875,
        527.5267944335938,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis (MIC) distribution of all   lineages that are circulating globally. Establishing or expanding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.983938217163086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.12261962890625,
        527.4064331054688,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis capacity for sequencing of   can provide a strong and future-proof platform for DST. If",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.152099609375,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "resistance to any of the component medicines in the BPaL regimen is detected, treatment with another",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962737083435059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.4266967773438,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "recommended regimen should be started. The WHO TB Supranational Reference Laboratory (SRL)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        527.6148071289062,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "Network is available to support national TB reference laboratories in performing quality-assured DST.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991847038269043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1986083984375,
        527.4015502929688,
        481.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "A WHO technical consultation in established critical concentrations for DST for the fluoroquinolones,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.12261962890625,
        527.4044799804688,
        494.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "(42, 43) bedaquiline, delamanid, clofazimine, pretomanid and linezolid  . When methods for DST are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.5986022949219,
        527.3875122070312,
        508.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "available, countries will need to add surveillance of resistance to new medicines to their routine efforts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973718643188477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.798583984375,
        527.5458984375,
        521.2415771484375
      ],
      "text": "or surveys. These data can guide the adoption and use of new regimens and can also protect against",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989845275878906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.9985961914062,
        230.20773315429688,
        534.4415893554688
      ],
      "text": "amplification of resistance profiles.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.8424682617188,
        197.2645263671875,
        566.5025024414062
      ],
      "text": "Drug–drug interactions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.71044921875,
        527.615478515625,
        588.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "It is important to take drug–drug interactions into account when administering TB and HIV medications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950489044189453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.634521484375,
        527.4215698242188,
        601.353515625
      ],
      "text": "(44) in combination, including the documented interactions between bedaquiline and efavirenz  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.1104125976562,
        527.4266357421875,
        614.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "Efavirenz reduces pretomanid exposures significantly; therefore, an alternative antiretroviral agent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.034423828125,
        527.4267578125,
        627.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "(39) should be considered if pretomanid forms part of the BPaLM/BPaL regimen  . The preferred ART",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.5103759765625,
        527.43212890625,
        640.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "regimens for co-administration with BPaLM/BPaL are dolutegravir-based regimens in combination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.7103881835938,
        309.1514892578125,
        654.1533813476562
      ],
      "text": "with two nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitors.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.5543212890625,
        184.57810974121094,
        686.21435546875
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.4222412109375,
        527.395751953125,
        707.865234375
      ],
      "text": "Several other groups of patients were excluded from the two trials; for example, patients with liver",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.6221923828125,
        527.4464111328125,
        721.065185546875
      ],
      "text": "enzyme measurements three or more times over the upper limit of normal; people with a corrected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.8223266601562,
        527.4279174804688,
        734.2653198242188
      ],
      "text": "QT interval by Fredericia (QTcF) more than 500 ms, or history of cardiac disease, syncopal episodes,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.022216796875,
        527.0726928710938,
        747.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "significant arrythmias, congenital QT prolongation, torsade de pointes or cardiomyopathy; those with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9822359085083,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.2222290039062,
        527.4371337890625,
        760.6652221679688
      ],
      "text": "a current peripheral neuropathy of Grade 3–4; and moribund patients with very low BMI (<17). These",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986541748046875,
